<title>USA: NYSE Unavailable - Walden Residential Properties.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailable - Walden Residential Properties.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday that Walden Residential Properties Inc was unavailable for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange also said Buenos Aires Embotelladora and Corimon SACA were unavailable for after-hours trade.</p>
